WEBVTT

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:05.208
After absorbing the crystal

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:08.333
from the B-rank Greater Demon in the dungeon,

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:10.458
Fran and I leveled up

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:13.375
and gained a rare skill.

00:00:14.416 --> 00:00:18.417
We basked in the victory
of our conquering our first dungeon.

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:21.250
But...

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.042
You there, little girl...

00:00:25.042 --> 00:00:28.582
You're lying!

00:00:28.582 --> 00:00:30.792
Who is this guy?

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:38.250
This guy...

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.000
I didn't sense his presence
before he opened the door.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.250
Who is he?

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.417
Who are you?

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:45.250
What?

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.207
You do not know who I am, little girl?

00:00:48.207 --> 00:00:49.542
Good grief.

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:52.625
This is why I cannot stand the lowly.

00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:54.957
Behold.

00:00:54.957 --> 00:00:57.832
My name is August Allsand.

00:00:57.832 --> 00:01:01.667
I am the Vice Captain of the Alessa Knights.

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:06.542
The knights...

00:01:06.542 --> 00:01:10.082
August, the vice captain of the knights,
is a noble and has a thing against adventurers,

00:01:10.082 --> 00:01:13.250
so he refused to send any knights
to assist in subjugating goblins.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.082
Is he the guy Ms. Nell told us about?

00:01:16.082 --> 00:01:17.542
"If only he could just drop dead."

00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:20.207
Oh? Did you say something just now?

00:01:20.207 --> 00:01:22.042
Nothing.

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:24.957
Crush.

00:01:24.957 --> 00:01:30.582
My unique skill, Essence of Falsehood,
allows me to see through all deceits.

00:01:30.582 --> 00:01:32.417
Unique skill?

00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:35.375
Do you understand? Lying...

00:01:35.375 --> 00:01:37.957
will not work on me.

00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:50.457
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:13.625
(Episode 7
The Vice Captain of the Knights Is Annoying)

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.792
You mean to say that she is lying?

00:03:17.792 --> 00:03:22.000
That little girl said
the crystal had disappeared.

00:03:23.042 --> 00:03:24.875
That's a lie.

00:03:24.875 --> 00:03:27.957
No, no. That wasn't a lie.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:32.625
I'm not lying. It did disappear.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.500
There you go again.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.417
Something's strange...

00:03:38.417 --> 00:03:39.832
Appraisal!

00:03:40.849 --> 00:03:43.207
(August Allsand)
Let's see. Level 30.

00:03:43.207 --> 00:03:45.667
(August Allsand)
His stats are awfully low for his level.

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:49.000
He is a knight,
but his Sword Art is only level one.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.457
That's kind of weak.

00:03:50.457 --> 00:03:53.125
(Equipment: Presence-Concealing Ring)
Ha, We couldn't detect his presence

00:03:53.125 --> 00:03:55.082
(Equipment: Presence-Concealing Ring)
because of his ring.

00:03:55.082 --> 00:03:57.707
And his unique skill...

00:03:57.707 --> 00:04:00.042
What sort of skill is Essence of Falsehood,

00:04:00.042 --> 00:04:01.250
Ms. Announcer?

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.957
Essence of Falsehood.

00:04:02.957 --> 00:04:04.792
A skill that allows the user
to see through others' lies

00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:08.750
and make their own lies
more convincing and harder to discern.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.832
I see.

00:04:10.832 --> 00:04:14.000
No, you're mistaken! I only picked it up!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.375
You're lying.

00:04:15.375 --> 00:04:18.333
I possess the skill to discern lies.

00:04:18.333 --> 00:04:20.750
This girl is a thief!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.583
He goes around telling others
that he has this skill.

00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:28.000
Please trust me! I'm telling the truth!

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:32.708
Then he accuses and convicts others as he wills.

00:04:33.416 --> 00:04:37.750
This guy must've been abusing his skill.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.125
Now, Guild Master,

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:43.625
hand over this little girl to the knights.

00:04:43.625 --> 00:04:45.416
I refuse.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.041
She blatantly lied
to a noble such as myself!

00:04:50.041 --> 00:04:52.708
Such a crime cannot go unpunished!

00:04:52.708 --> 00:04:54.833
Well, I must warn you

00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:59.541
that she is not someone you can handle.

00:04:59.541 --> 00:05:04.000
After all, she is an adventurer
who soloed the Greater Demon.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.541
Well, in that case, the knights will confiscate

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:10.208
the loot and crystal of the Greater Demon

00:05:10.208 --> 00:05:12.250
as compensation. We will leave it at that.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.083
Why would I allow that?

00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:18.583
The materials have been officially
turned over to the guild.

00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:21.416
Even if she holds the crystal,
it would be rightfully hers.

00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:26.333
After all, the knights refused
to participate in the subjugation.

00:05:27.708 --> 00:05:30.833
That gives you no right
to claim any of the gains.

00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:32.583
Well said, Guild Master!

00:05:32.583 --> 00:05:37.000
Now, listen here. You couldn't be certain
of the situation in the dungeon.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.375
Under such circumstances,

00:05:38.375 --> 00:05:42.916
we couldn't possibly dispatch
our capable and noble knights.

00:05:42.916 --> 00:05:46.166
That sort of thing should be left

00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:50.083
to the lowly adventurers.

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:55.833
They made sacrifices and put their lives
on the line to resolve this matter.

00:05:55.833 --> 00:05:58.916
Please do not belittle or insult them.

00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:00.958
On top of that,

00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:04.791
I don't believe there's a reason
Captain Urus would turn our request down...

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:09.708
Unless its submission was halted on your desk?

00:06:09.708 --> 00:06:12.458
Of... of course not!

00:06:12.458 --> 00:06:15.791
Then I presume you wouldn't mind
if I verified this matter with Captain Urus.

00:06:15.791 --> 00:06:18.083
You... Do you intend
to oppose not only the knights

00:06:18.083 --> 00:06:21.250
but also my father, Count Holmes?

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.666
I would prefer not to have
to come to that, if possible.

00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:29.291
It looks like there's quite a power struggle
between the guild and the knights.

00:06:30.375 --> 00:06:31.458
Fran.

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:35.208
Here, I'll give you two this,
so please stop arguing.

00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:39.666
Finally going to hand over
the loot from the demon, are you?

00:06:43.291 --> 00:06:45.791
Goblin horns...

00:06:45.791 --> 00:06:49.041
Do you mean to affront me!?
Get those dirty things away from me!

00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:55.041
You! What on earth did you teach her?

00:06:55.041 --> 00:06:56.208
How dare

00:06:56.208 --> 00:06:58.625
-That was quite the provocation, Fran.
-she insult me so!

00:06:58.625 --> 00:07:00.208
Teacher...

00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:02.041
Huh? Fran?

00:07:02.041 --> 00:07:04.125
I won't forgive him...

00:07:04.125 --> 00:07:06.375
Oh, you're seriously infuriated!

00:07:06.375 --> 00:07:07.875
Can I kill him?

00:07:07.875 --> 00:07:09.291
No, no, no... Hold your horses!

00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:10.583
Calm down, Fran!

00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:12.375
If you kill a noble
in the guild master's office,

00:07:12.375 --> 00:07:16.041
your name will go down in Alessa's history.
Please refrain from doing so!

00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:18.083
Oh, right.

00:07:18.083 --> 00:07:21.666
That guy seems like a despicable character.
Let's try out that new skill.

00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:24.791
Together then.

00:07:24.791 --> 00:07:26.208
What's with you?

00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:28.125
Skill Taker.

00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:38.083
Teacher has successfully
taken a unique skill, Essence of Falsehood 5.

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:42.291
Fran has successfully
taken the skill, Court Etiquette 4.

00:07:42.291 --> 00:07:45.375
That's a 100% success rate for you!

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:50.250
"I am 100 years old."

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.666
Can you tell if I'm lying or telling the truth?

00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:57.375
What's with this all of a sudden?
I can easily...

00:07:57.375 --> 00:07:59.250
Answer me.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.958
You're obviously...

00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:02.875
Answer me.

00:08:02.875 --> 00:08:04.750
Shut... shut up!

00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:08.750
What... What's going on?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.208
Can you not tell?

00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:13.041
I'm not feeling well today,

00:08:13.041 --> 00:08:14.500
so I shall be going home now!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:18.583
But I'll be back! Just you jerks wait!

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:23.541
Pardon the intrusion.

00:08:23.541 --> 00:08:24.583
Nell!

00:08:24.583 --> 00:08:27.416
Fran, you're back.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.332
I apologize for that.

00:08:32.332 --> 00:08:36.750
That imbecile bought his position with money.

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:38.542
He is a foul man.

00:08:40.582 --> 00:08:42.707
His level is fairly high,

00:08:42.707 --> 00:08:45.207
but it's a common thing

00:08:45.207 --> 00:08:48.457
for nobles to hire strong knights and parties

00:08:48.457 --> 00:08:50.582
to fight high-rank monsters for them,

00:08:50.582 --> 00:08:54.082
and they simply leech the experience
and increase their levels that way.

00:08:54.082 --> 00:08:56.292
Is that what they call power-leveling?

00:08:56.292 --> 00:08:59.125
I guess there are times
when levels don't matter.

00:08:59.792 --> 00:09:02.125
To think that man is from a major noble family

00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:04.957
that governs the town, the son of Count Holmes.

00:09:04.957 --> 00:09:08.417
So that's why even the guild master
can't be too tough on him.

00:09:08.417 --> 00:09:09.500
Miss Fran,

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.000
he might hold a grudge
against you for what happened.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.750
You must be careful.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.707
I'll be fine.

00:09:16.707 --> 00:09:18.417
That's all I have to say.

00:09:18.417 --> 00:09:22.917
No matter what,
the guild is thankful for your assistance.

00:09:22.917 --> 00:09:25.082
Nell, is everything prepared?

00:09:25.082 --> 00:09:27.042
Yes. Everything is ready.

00:09:27.042 --> 00:09:28.500
Miss Fran,

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.582
please drop by the counter
to rank up before you leave.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.042
Am I going to be rank E now?

00:09:35.042 --> 00:09:38.250
No. You'll be promoted straight to rank D.

00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:42.707
You defeated a monster of threat level B
that could threaten a city's safety.

00:09:42.707 --> 00:09:45.082
So I put in a request
for you to be promoted to rank C.

00:09:45.082 --> 00:09:47.582
but that was too big of a jump.

00:09:47.582 --> 00:09:50.167
It wasn't approved by the other guild branches.

00:09:50.167 --> 00:09:53.332
Well, Fran just became
an adventurer not long ago.

00:09:53.332 --> 00:09:54.792
That's understandable.

00:09:54.792 --> 00:09:56.332
Got it.

00:09:56.332 --> 00:09:59.417
Don't forget to collect your reward and payment.

00:09:59.417 --> 00:10:01.582
We've included a bonus for you too.

00:10:01.582 --> 00:10:02.707
Really?

00:10:02.707 --> 00:10:04.792
I'm so happy to hear that!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.850
(Skill Activated: Court Etiquette)

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:10.000
(Skill Activated: Court Etiquette)
Thank you.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.250
You... you're welcome.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.625
Fran, you're so cute!

00:10:17.707 --> 00:10:20.667
I didn't know that she had such refined manners.

00:10:20.667 --> 00:10:24.917
If you use a stolen skill too much,
it'll rouse suspicion.

00:10:24.917 --> 00:10:28.207
But I've always wanted to do that.

00:10:28.207 --> 00:10:29.167
Never mind.

00:10:29.167 --> 00:10:32.792
I was worried you would only
mature physically but not mentally.

00:10:32.792 --> 00:10:34.207
I guess I can rest assured now.

00:10:34.207 --> 00:10:35.582
Physically but not mentally?

00:10:35.582 --> 00:10:36.542
For real?

00:10:36.542 --> 00:10:37.457
Amazing!

00:10:37.457 --> 00:10:40.582
Congratulations on reaching rank D, Fran!

00:10:40.582 --> 00:10:43.832
And here you go. This is your reward.

00:10:43.832 --> 00:10:45.582
Thank you, Nell.

00:10:45.582 --> 00:10:48.082
That's quite a hefty sum.

00:10:48.082 --> 00:10:49.582
You are amazing, little girl.

00:10:49.582 --> 00:10:51.207
Jeez. You're already rank D now.

00:10:51.207 --> 00:10:52.667
Mr. Dwarf.

00:10:52.667 --> 00:10:54.667
The name's Elevent.

00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:58.207
Feel free to look for me
if you ever need a member for your party.

00:10:58.207 --> 00:11:00.417
You've got some moves.

00:11:00.417 --> 00:11:01.750
You can even jump into the air.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.667
I heard you took down
a Greater Demon. Is that true?

00:11:04.667 --> 00:11:06.792
You saved me during the battle.

00:11:06.792 --> 00:11:08.417
Have a juice on me.

00:11:08.417 --> 00:11:10.000
We'll pay for your drinks too.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.832
Have a chat with us!

00:11:11.832 --> 00:11:15.000
Too close!
Stay away from her, you middle-aged men!

00:11:15.917 --> 00:11:19.000
Well... Fran seems to be in a good mood.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.250
Fran,

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.832
you got a big bonus.

00:11:21.832 --> 00:11:24.207
Maybe you should treat everyone here.

00:11:24.207 --> 00:11:26.875
They're our allies
who fought together with us, after all.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.542
Drink up, everyone! Drinks are on me tonight!

00:11:33.542 --> 00:11:35.542
You're quite a figure now!

00:11:37.292 --> 00:11:39.875
How big-hearted you are, little girl!

00:11:39.875 --> 00:11:41.875
No, my heart is normal.

00:11:47.207 --> 00:11:48.875
Goodness, those guys.

00:11:48.875 --> 00:11:52.042
Were they trying
to drink up the entire pub's supply?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.250
If Fran had done

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:56.792
as I said

00:11:56.792 --> 00:11:59.292
and retreated,

00:11:59.292 --> 00:12:03.625
the town would probably not be alight now...

00:12:03.625 --> 00:12:07.167
Fran is truly amazing.

00:12:07.167 --> 00:12:11.707
Teacher... curry... you promised...

00:12:11.707 --> 00:12:14.750
That's right. We made a promise.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:18.792
All right. We'll have curry tomorrow, Fran.

00:12:19.957 --> 00:12:23.750
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:12:25.125 --> 00:12:26.250
What's this?

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:28.957
Who are they?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.167
What are they saying?

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:36.792
Do they want me to touch it?

00:12:36.792 --> 00:12:39.500
Is that me?

00:12:41.457 --> 00:12:45.582
Teacher... Teacher!

00:12:45.582 --> 00:12:47.500
What's the matter, Teacher?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.375
No, it's nothing.

00:12:50.417 --> 00:12:52.082
What was that?

00:12:52.082 --> 00:12:53.250
A dream?

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:56.582
Me, a sword who doesn't even
need sleep, had a dream?

00:12:58.457 --> 00:13:02.042
Curry! Curry!

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:06.917
Today, we'll be using a bunch of spices
and ingredients we bought from Rufus's

00:13:06.917 --> 00:13:09.667
to make hearty camp food! To be more precise,

00:13:09.667 --> 00:13:12.417
food that can sustain Fran for several days.

00:13:12.417 --> 00:13:14.832
Cooked food won't spoil
once it's placed into the dimensional storage,

00:13:14.832 --> 00:13:18.332
and Fran will be able
to get a warm meal whenever she needs one.

00:13:19.125 --> 00:13:21.707
I'm ready, Teacher!

00:13:22.542 --> 00:13:25.292
Fran looks good in everything!

00:13:25.292 --> 00:13:27.457
We probably spent about 100,000 gold

00:13:27.457 --> 00:13:30.625
on spices, ingredients, and cookware.

00:13:30.625 --> 00:13:33.832
But for Fran, it's all worth it!

00:13:35.667 --> 00:13:36.832
Now,

00:13:36.832 --> 00:13:39.125
time to cook!

00:13:39.832 --> 00:13:44.750
First, prepare 30kg
of minced Rock Bison and Ramming Python meat.

00:13:45.375 --> 00:13:46.667
Meat!

00:13:46.667 --> 00:13:49.457
Now then,
Fran, with the title of the King of Cookery.

00:13:49.457 --> 00:13:50.292
Yes!

00:13:50.292 --> 00:13:52.375
Give the meat a thorough massage.

00:13:52.375 --> 00:13:53.875
Understood!

00:13:55.707 --> 00:14:00.625
Then use Aura Blade to chop up all the onions

00:14:00.625 --> 00:14:02.250
and stir-fry them!

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.250
Fran!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.375
Teacher!

00:14:04.375 --> 00:14:05.250
- Combine!
- Combine!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.042
(Fried onions are cooled down.)

00:14:06.042 --> 00:14:07.667
And bread crumbs!

00:14:07.667 --> 00:14:09.457
With spices!

00:14:09.457 --> 00:14:11.332
- Everything is up to this punch!
- Everything is up to this punch!

00:14:11.332 --> 00:14:13.500
- Knead...
- Knead...

00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:19.207
Then fry all the patties!

00:14:20.125 --> 00:14:21.792
Meat!

00:14:21.792 --> 00:14:25.457
The demi-glace is ready too.

00:14:25.457 --> 00:14:28.125
Hamburger patties, come on!

00:14:28.125 --> 00:14:30.750
Slather them generously with the sauce...

00:14:31.875 --> 00:14:35.207
and my original
demi-glace hamburger steak is complete!

00:14:35.207 --> 00:14:36.957
It looks so yummy!

00:14:36.957 --> 00:14:39.417
Into the dimensional storage, they go!

00:14:40.207 --> 00:14:42.332
At least let me have one!

00:14:42.332 --> 00:14:43.625
Now then, Fran,

00:14:43.625 --> 00:14:46.125
let us prepare the main dish.

00:14:46.125 --> 00:14:48.000
The main dish?

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.750
It's the long-awaited curry!

00:14:51.417 --> 00:14:53.542
There it is! Curry!

00:14:53.542 --> 00:14:58.125
Cut the carefully selected
root vegetables into large chunks.

00:14:58.125 --> 00:15:00.750
As promised, I bought plenty of meat.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.375
Using a blend of spices

00:15:02.375 --> 00:15:05.625
will make the dish
more flavorful and aromatic too.

00:15:05.625 --> 00:15:08.417
Using milk made from a coconut-like fruit

00:15:08.417 --> 00:15:10.832
will give the curry a mild touch.

00:15:15.957 --> 00:15:17.417
The curry smells wonderful!

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:19.457
Smells appetising, doesn't it?

00:15:19.457 --> 00:15:21.667
This is the power of spice!

00:15:21.667 --> 00:15:24.457
The rice is perfectly cooked as well.

00:15:24.457 --> 00:15:26.875
The dish is complete.

00:15:26.875 --> 00:15:29.332
So this is...

00:15:29.332 --> 00:15:33.667
My original super deluxe curry, medium spicy!

00:15:33.667 --> 00:15:35.917
So this is curry...

00:15:35.917 --> 00:15:38.332
I've prepared three types of curries.
Mild, medium spicy, and extra spicy.

00:15:38.332 --> 00:15:42.292
Each of them is prepared
with different meats, vegetables, and spices.

00:15:42.292 --> 00:15:43.875
I shall dig in.

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:54.207
What is this?

00:15:56.292 --> 00:15:58.500
It's super delicious!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.792
Good, isn't it?

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.082
Finished!

00:16:05.207 --> 00:16:06.917
Teacher...

00:16:06.917 --> 00:16:08.417
Are you satisfied?

00:16:08.417 --> 00:16:11.457
I was born for the curry.

00:16:11.457 --> 00:16:13.417
You like it that much?

00:16:13.417 --> 00:16:15.542
Well, eating is the joy of living.

00:16:15.542 --> 00:16:18.082
I'll make curry for you anytime you want.

00:16:18.082 --> 00:16:21.167
We'll store the left
in the dimensional storage.

00:16:21.167 --> 00:16:23.292
I get to eat curry anytime I want!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.125
A week passed after the goblin subjugation.

00:16:28.125 --> 00:16:30.250
While waiting for Garrus to complete the armor,

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:33.875
we took on some quests,
like finding rare potatoes in the mountains...

00:16:36.375 --> 00:16:38.167
This might taste good in curry!

00:16:38.167 --> 00:16:42.707
Delivering letters to nobles
in exchange for premium pork...

00:16:42.707 --> 00:16:45.750
I want to make King Pork Curry!

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.332
We also took on subjugation quests

00:16:47.332 --> 00:16:50.332
to get more crystal exp.

00:16:50.332 --> 00:16:52.000
Dimensional Storage!

00:16:52.875 --> 00:16:54.250
Fish might go well

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.457
with curry too!

00:16:57.457 --> 00:16:58.707
Well done!

00:16:58.707 --> 00:17:00.832
Ingredients acquired.

00:17:00.832 --> 00:17:02.457
Teacher...

00:17:02.457 --> 00:17:03.375
Yes?

00:17:03.375 --> 00:17:05.833
The fish and the swamp water

00:17:05.833 --> 00:17:07.541
didn't foul the curry, right?

00:17:07.541 --> 00:17:09.625
Not even a single drop. Don't worry.

00:17:10.875 --> 00:17:12.041
Curry!

00:17:12.041 --> 00:17:13.666
All right. Well, since I've taken them out,

00:17:13.666 --> 00:17:16.291
would you like to try
the mild and extra spicy curries too?

00:17:16.291 --> 00:17:18.416
First, the extra spicy curry.

00:17:18.416 --> 00:17:19.833
The combination
of the pungent spice, fried root vegetables,

00:17:19.833 --> 00:17:23.875
the savouriness of the meat,
and the mild sweetness of fat...

00:17:23.875 --> 00:17:25.625
It's a curry with an adult flavor profile.

00:17:25.625 --> 00:17:28.583
It's spicy but delicious.

00:17:28.583 --> 00:17:30.333
Next, the mild curry.

00:17:30.333 --> 00:17:31.875
It tastes mild due to the milk,

00:17:31.875 --> 00:17:35.291
but with the subtle sweetness and
fragrance from the fruits,

00:17:35.291 --> 00:17:37.375
the richness of meat stands out more.

00:17:37.375 --> 00:17:39.208
Satisfaction guaranteed!

00:17:39.208 --> 00:17:41.208
It's mild and tender!

00:17:41.208 --> 00:17:42.458
(Teacher)
Now then, Ms. Fran,

00:17:42.458 --> 00:17:44.375
which tastes the best?

00:17:44.375 --> 00:17:46.166
All of them taste wonderful!

00:17:46.166 --> 00:17:48.666
She is completely captivated by curry.

00:17:49.625 --> 00:17:52.750
But while we were immersed
in the world of gourmet food,

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:56.416
things have been less peaceful in Alessa...

00:17:56.416 --> 00:17:59.791
We only got seven crystal exp this week.

00:17:59.791 --> 00:18:02.166
Not as efficient as in a dungeon...

00:18:02.166 --> 00:18:03.208
Indeed.

00:18:03.208 --> 00:18:06.791
- We won't be able to level up at this rate.
- You're clear.

00:18:06.791 --> 00:18:08.916
Fran!

00:18:08.916 --> 00:18:10.500
Oh, it's the gatekeeper.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.208
We've become familiar with the guard here.

00:18:13.208 --> 00:18:14.666
Say, Fran,

00:18:14.666 --> 00:18:16.666
do you know Viscount Allsand?

00:18:16.666 --> 00:18:18.750
Biscuit Allspice...?

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:22.333
No. He means the noble
we met in the guild master's office.

00:18:23.166 --> 00:18:24.666
The pathetic vice captain.

00:18:24.666 --> 00:18:26.083
How blunt!

00:18:26.083 --> 00:18:27.708
Excuse her.

00:18:27.708 --> 00:18:30.041
Um, well, for some reason,

00:18:30.041 --> 00:18:33.333
that "pathetic vice captain"
has been looking for you.

00:18:33.333 --> 00:18:34.541
From what I heard,

00:18:34.541 --> 00:18:37.166
he handled himself poorly before royalty

00:18:37.166 --> 00:18:40.083
and angered his father, Count Holmes.

00:18:40.083 --> 00:18:42.541
It seems that he has been driven to desperation.

00:18:42.541 --> 00:18:44.458
I don't know how you got involved with him,

00:18:44.458 --> 00:18:47.416
but there are all kinds of bad rumors
about that man.

00:18:47.416 --> 00:18:49.125
Who knows what he might do?

00:18:49.125 --> 00:18:50.250
Do be careful.

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.875
Got it.

00:18:51.875 --> 00:18:53.208
Thank you.

00:18:53.208 --> 00:18:54.916
Cheers!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.708
He disgraced himself in front of royalty, huh?

00:18:59.708 --> 00:19:03.250
It might be because we took his skills from him.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:07.041
But he targeted us first, so he had it coming.

00:19:08.375 --> 00:19:09.500
Fran,

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.375
don't look back. We're being followed.

00:19:12.375 --> 00:19:13.916
It would be easy to lose them,

00:19:13.916 --> 00:19:17.250
but that wouldn't get rid of them for good.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.500
Let's lure them somewhere to take care of them.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.916
Okay.

00:19:30.125 --> 00:19:31.708
Two?

00:19:31.708 --> 00:19:32.791
Yes.

00:19:37.708 --> 00:19:39.583
Can I help you?

00:19:41.625 --> 00:19:44.000
You... you...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:49.000
At that time, you put a curse on me, didn't you?

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.250
You wretched beastkin!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.375
The undead?

00:19:52.375 --> 00:19:53.416
Appraisal!

00:19:53.416 --> 00:19:56.166
(August Allsand)
He is that pathetic vice captain.

00:19:56.166 --> 00:19:57.541
(August Allsand)
Well, he still seems human... yet...

00:19:57.541 --> 00:19:59.750
(August Allsand)
You...

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.291
It's all your fault!

00:20:01.291 --> 00:20:03.625
My life is ruined!

00:20:03.625 --> 00:20:05.833
You'll pay for this!

00:20:05.833 --> 00:20:07.125
Who are you?

00:20:07.125 --> 00:20:09.708
Huh? You didn't recognize him, Fran?

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:12.708
Huh? Did you forget about me?

00:20:12.708 --> 00:20:14.208
I don't think we've met before.

00:20:14.208 --> 00:20:15.958
It can't be... Really?

00:20:15.958 --> 00:20:19.125
Oh, I got the wrong person...

00:20:19.125 --> 00:20:22.583
Don't lie! There's no way
I mistook you for someone else!

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.833
But I don't recall meeting you at all.

00:20:25.833 --> 00:20:27.458
Real... really?

00:20:27.458 --> 00:20:29.375
Yes.

00:20:30.708 --> 00:20:35.291
But I remember
that girl carrying a huge sword...

00:20:35.291 --> 00:20:37.416
Wait! That's the sword!

00:20:37.416 --> 00:20:40.333
You are that filthy brat!

00:20:40.333 --> 00:20:42.041
He found out, after all.

00:20:42.041 --> 00:20:43.583
It's all because of you

00:20:43.583 --> 00:20:45.708
that a noble like me ended up in this state!

00:20:45.708 --> 00:20:47.416
I won't forgive you!

00:20:47.416 --> 00:20:50.416
Well, it's not as if we care.

00:20:52.125 --> 00:20:54.083
How dare you glare at me!

00:20:54.083 --> 00:20:55.916
You are the lowest of the low.

00:20:55.916 --> 00:20:58.500
A dirty Black Cat.

00:21:00.708 --> 00:21:02.791
Oh, hit a nerve, did I?

00:21:02.791 --> 00:21:04.833
Hey! Gyuran!

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:10.875
Hmph. A little Black Cat, huh?

00:21:10.875 --> 00:21:12.666
Leave her to me.

00:21:12.666 --> 00:21:18.666
We have a well-practised way of
dealing with her kind.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.583
Shall I beat her up and sell her?

00:21:21.583 --> 00:21:24.458
Chop her up as feed for the hunting dogs?

00:21:24.458 --> 00:21:28.291
Or skin her and throw her into the lavatory?

00:21:28.291 --> 00:21:30.708
That's a good idea.

00:21:30.708 --> 00:21:32.541
Blue Cat!

00:21:32.541 --> 00:21:34.583
Blue Cat?

00:21:34.583 --> 00:21:36.583
Fran, what's the matter?

00:21:36.583 --> 00:21:40.000
Blue Cats are the enemies of Black Cats!

00:21:41.083 --> 00:21:44.333
It's my first time seeing Fran like this...

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:40.041
(Next Episode
Blue Cats Are Enemies)
